    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/97cc755567877153b903e2907044770a.poster.avif?t=1754574683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/97cc755567877153b903e2907044770a.webm?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/97cc755567877153b903e2907044770a.mp4?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantomware</strong> is an episodic psychological horror game where overtime shifts turn into something far more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More episodes coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/10285c5bb6ef224b3706018931e0e1da.poster.avif?t=1754574683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/10285c5bb6ef224b3706018931e0e1da.webm?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/10285c5bb6ef224b3706018931e0e1da.mp4?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHANTOMWARE: 0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re working late, testing a mysterious game for a shady client, but as glitches appear and messages grow unsettling, you start to question what\u2019s real. The game\u2019s eerie presence spreads beyond the screen, with the mysterious virus connecting the digital and physical worlds. Cryptic clues and strange occurrences lead you deeper into a chilling mystery, where the boundary between reality and the game starts to collapse. You soon start realizing that there might be no escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/88ffa31ec2138da77827f031ee80a7b6.poster.avif?t=1754574683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/88ffa31ec2138da77827f031ee80a7b6.webm?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/88ffa31ec2138da77827f031ee80a7b6.mp4?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo-realistic visuals</strong> with an eerie atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS aesthetic</strong> for a retro horror feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text messaging</strong>\u00a0receive and reply messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel OS</strong>\u00a0a fully interactive mini operating system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games</strong>\u00a0but not all are safe to play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/279a6e21e513596d5163796b9c670ded.avif?t=1754574683\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/97cc755567877153b903e2907044770a.poster.avif?t=1754574683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/97cc755567877153b903e2907044770a.webm?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/97cc755567877153b903e2907044770a.mp4?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantomware</strong> is an episodic psychological horror game where overtime shifts turn into something far more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More episodes coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/10285c5bb6ef224b3706018931e0e1da.poster.avif?t=1754574683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/10285c5bb6ef224b3706018931e0e1da.webm?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/10285c5bb6ef224b3706018931e0e1da.mp4?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHANTOMWARE: 0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re working late, testing a mysterious game for a shady client, but as glitches appear and messages grow unsettling, you start to question what\u2019s real. The game\u2019s eerie presence spreads beyond the screen, with the mysterious virus connecting the digital and physical worlds. Cryptic clues and strange occurrences lead you deeper into a chilling mystery, where the boundary between reality and the game starts to collapse. You soon start realizing that there might be no escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/88ffa31ec2138da77827f031ee80a7b6.poster.avif?t=1754574683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/88ffa31ec2138da77827f031ee80a7b6.webm?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/88ffa31ec2138da77827f031ee80a7b6.mp4?t=1754574683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo-realistic visuals</strong> with an eerie atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS aesthetic</strong> for a retro horror feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text messaging</strong>\u00a0receive and reply messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel OS</strong>\u00a0a fully interactive mini operating system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games</strong>\u00a0but not all are safe to play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/279a6e21e513596d5163796b9c670ded.avif?t=1754574683\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "It starts like any other late shift\u2014quiet office, dull glow of the monitor, work dragging on. You think you\u2019re alone. But then the screen flickers. A message pops up. Not from your team. Not from anyone you know. Suddenly the silence feels heavier. Something\u2019s here. And it doesn\u2019t want you to leave.",
